<A NAME="TOC_NOTES"><H2>NOTES</H2>
<P><A NAME="fn1">(1) I wish to express here my heartfelt thanks
to St�phane Agn�s ROBERT
for a fruitful suggestion, that embarked me
on the exploration of a typological path,
starting from my peaceful retreat
among the traditional Tamil medieval commentators.
I also wish to thank here
Eva WILDEN, Nalini BALBIR, Thomas LEHMAN,
Fran�ois GROS, Jan HOUBEN, Nagamanickam GANESAN,
K. KALYANASUNDARAM, K.S. NAGARAJA, Peri BHASKARARAO,
