<P><A NAME="fn7">(7) See (A) in 1.2.

<P><A NAME="fn8">(8) It will be clear to all
who are familiar with the diglossic situation of Tamil, that
<i>ti��re��u</i> is the item which corresponds in the formal variety of
Tamil to the <i>di�iir-��u</i> (=A17) mentioned by Asher in his
