[expressions] telles (3a)// Sont paroles suggestives, qui disent
[en fait] `[ces choses] sont telles' (4)// Au moyen des
comportements [qui sont pr�t�s] � chacune (3b).


<P><A NAME="fn23">(23) His examples are: <i>aval aval
e�ki��a�a nel</i> and <i>ma�ai ma�ai e�ki��a�a pim ku�</i>. See
Chevillard[1996, p. 514]

<P><A NAME="fn24">(24) Fortunately, some very
useful data bases are to-day avilable online, thanks to
