<A NAME="TOC_A"><H2>APPENDIX_A: 646 entries extracted
from the <i>Madras Tamil Lexicon</i> (by groups)</H2>


<P>Note: each of the 646 items bears two tags:
<BR> the first tag refers to the subgroup and is for indexation
purpose
<BR> the second tag is more content-oriented. For instance, in the
third position, "C" tags color terms, "Z" tags items
connected to animals, "X" tags items that were originally
kept in group 6, but were later moved to other groups due to
morphological similarities.

